## What It Feels Like To Use
```
$ astra

  ▸ astra v0.1.0 — knowing your codebase since 3 weeks ago
  ▸ 47,832 symbols indexed · 12 services · 4 languages

  You: migrate user auth from TS to Go, keep test coverage

  astra: Found auth module in /services/auth 
         TypeScript, 847 lines, 23 tests.

         Plan:
         1. Translate AuthService → Go struct with methods
         2. Map JWTPayload interface → Go struct with json tags
         3. Rewrite 23 tests using testify
