## Why Nobody Else Has Built This

| Existing Tool | What It Misses |
|---------------|---------------|
| Aider | No memory, single language context, resets every session |
| GitHub Copilot | Cloud only, no cross language understanding |
| Claude Code | No persistent codebase graph |
| ast-grep | Just search/replace, no AI, no migration planning |
| OpenRewrite | Java only, no conversational interface |

