At a glance, every morning, you know exactly what needs attention.

🔐 7. Security Vulnerability Hunter
bash$ astra "audit the entire codebase for security issues"

Understands your specific stack deeply
Doesn't just run static analysis — reasons about vulnerabilities
Traces data flow across languages
"Your Python service accepts user input on line 47 and it reaches the Go database layer unsanitized through these 4 hops"

No existing tool traces vulnerabilities across language boundaries.

🤝 8. PR Autopilot
bash$ astra ship "add rate limiting to the API"
Codex:

Writes the code
Writes the tests
Writes the PR description
Checks it against your team's PR standards
Self-reviews and fixes issues
Opens the PR
Responds to reviewer comments autonomously

You just described what you want. Codex handles the entire lifecycle.

🌍 9. Legacy Code Archaeologist
The feature enterprises would pay fortunes for:
bash$ astra "explain this COBOL service written in 1987"
